{"inkVersion":20,"root":[["ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Well hey, that’s pretty good.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Thanks! I thought you might like a little kick in your drink.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^So, what has you all riled up like this?","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I really don’t feel like sharing the specifics. But I had something valuable, now I don’t.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^A long time ago, I had a friend. He wanted to be the mayor of this town. He was crushed by a rock-","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Sorry to hear that-","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I wasn’t done. He was crushed by a rock, came back as an evil ninja who could teleport.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Oh wow.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Still not done- then I impaled him.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Ok I get it-","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Then he stabbed me.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Oh boy it’s still going.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Then we became friends again.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Oh how sweet-","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Then he died.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Yikes…","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^The point is, even though we lose, we should always try to be better.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Wow that was really dee-","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Because we don’t know if they’re watching us waiting to stab us if we kill our mutual friend by accident.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Uhh, thanks.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Anyways I better get going, I have a couple late night quests.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Good luck.","\n","ev","str","^Itachi","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I make my own luck.","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}